OL,3,GNEWSABradford's 'hidden gem' hosts 30th
OL,4,Afilm festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bradford cinema that offers
OL,7,Fscreenings in a "unique" format is
OL,8,Fcelebrating 30 years of its film
OL,9,Ffestival.
OL,11,FPictureville Cinema, based at the
OL,12,FNational Science and Media Museum,
OL,13,Fhosts its Widescreen Weekend each year,
OL,14,Fshowcasing films in a range of formats,
OL,15,Fincluding 70mm, 35mm and Cinerama.
OL,17,FCinerama technology, developed in the
OL,18,F1950s, uses three synchronised
OL,19,Fprojectors to display images onto a
OL,20,Fdeeply curved wide screen.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
