OL,3,GNEWSABradford's 'hidden gem' hosts 30th
OL,4,Afilm festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Weedon, Screen Programme Producer
OL,7,Ffor the festival, said: "We are kind of
OL,8,Fa hidden gem, because it is kind of a
OL,9,Fniche interest, so it kind of flies
OL,10,Funder people's radar."
